## Local platform / working outputs
## NOTE: keep these anchored to the repo root. Unanchored "**/reports/" also matched
## source/GmpPlatform.Core/Reports/ (git uses case-insensitive matching on Windows),
## which silently kept RunReportWriter.cs out of the repository.
.local/
deliverables/
/exports/
/logs/
/reports/

